{"2290490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Helpless", "steam_appid": 2290490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.poster.avif?t=1698691017\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.webm?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.mp4?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A mother and her child are trying desperately to find shelter in order to survive harsh conditions. A tragic event makes them come together more than ever. On top of everything, their only way to travel breaks down. <br><br>In <strong>HELPLESS</strong>, take the role of a kid and explore a decaying land where the sun ruined civilization as we know it. Find abandoned places and scavenge them for items in order to make sense of the world you’re in. All the help you need during this perilous trip might come to you in unexpected forms. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.poster.avif?t=1698691017\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.webm?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.mp4?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNCOVER A LOST PAST </strong><br>Find items and different locations to understand your surroundings.<br><br><strong>HIDE FROM THE SUN</strong><br>Cover yourself from the dangers of the sun and carefully manage your moves.<br><br><strong>DEVELOP RELATIONSHIPS</strong> <br>Share your findings with your mom by interacting with her and get better knowledge about your family with the support of a new friend.<br><br><strong>CONTEMPLATE COMPELLING VISUALS</strong><br>Look at the world around you with dynamic cameras and a semi-realistic art style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/cbb0cd35db2b7dc0fce89d2ea755682a.poster.avif?t=1698691017\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/cbb0cd35db2b7dc0fce89d2ea755682a.webm?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/cbb0cd35db2b7dc0fce89d2ea755682a.mp4?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>26 achievements to unlock<br></li><li>Original soundtrack<br></li><li>Multiple collectibles to find<br></li><li>English and French versions<br></li><li>Colorblind-friendly<br></li><li>Survivor or Explorator mode</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.poster.avif?t=1698691017\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.webm?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/bdd0769ca2918398463a9f6ad1b489db.mp4?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A mother and her child are trying desperately to find shelter in order to survive harsh conditions. A tragic event makes them come together more than ever. On top of everything, their only way to travel breaks down. <br><br>In <strong>HELPLESS</strong>, take the role of a kid and explore a decaying land where the sun ruined civilization as we know it. Find abandoned places and scavenge them for items in order to make sense of the world you’re in. All the help you need during this perilous trip might come to you in unexpected forms. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.poster.avif?t=1698691017\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.webm?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/11f973f2a79a8025d938be597b22213c.mp4?t=1698691017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNCOVER A LOST PAST </strong><br>Find items and different locations to understand your surroundings.<br><br><strong>HIDE FROM THE SUN</strong><br>Cover yourself from the dangers of the sun and carefully manage your moves.<br><br><strong>DEVELOP RELATIONSHIPS</strong> <br>Share your findings with your mom by interacting with her and get better knowledge about your family with the support of a new friend.<br><br><strong>CONTEMPLATE COMPELLING VISUALS</strong><br>Look at the world around you with dynamic cameras and a semi-realistic art style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290490/extras/cbb0cd35db2b7dc0fce89d2ea7